   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Touch Me I'm Going To Scream (Pt. 1)**: rare: 14 archived performances [3]\n- **Touch Me I'm Going To Scream (Pt. 2)**: rare: 14 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2022-09-23.mk4v.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 23 songs; 152 min [1]\n- **MMJ2022-09-23.NSL**: source not stated; 23 songs; 151 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2022-09-23.mk4v.flac16**: taped by Martin Medley; transferred by Martin Medley; source: Schoeps MK4V > KC5 > CMC6 > Sound Devices Mix-Pre 6 (24bit/48kHz) [1]. Also: The audio was transferred via Wavelab 6.1 and converted to FLAC format [1]\n- **MMJ2022-09-23.NSL**: taped by NSL; transferred by NSL; source: Berliner CM-33's > Tascam DR-60MKII (24/48) [2]. Also: Berliner CM-33 microphones were used with a Tascam DR-60MKII recorder; The recording was transferred using Amadeus Pro and xACT software [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by @https://twitter.com/hersmiles_co: [My Morning Jacket September 23 2022 Ascend Amphitheater Nashville Tn Poster Shirt - Hersmiles](https://hersmiles.co/product/my-morning-jacket-september-23-2022-ascend-amphitheater-nashville-tn-poster-shirt/) [4]\n- Poster by Ascend Amphitheater: [My Morning Jacket Tickets | 23rd September](https://www.nashvilleamphitheater.net/events/my-morning-jacket/) [5]\n- Poster by @https://twitter.com/hersmiles_co: [My Morning Jacket September 23 2022 Ascend Amphitheater Nashville Tn Poster Shirt - Hersmiles](https://hersmiles.co/product/my-morning-jacket-september-23-2022-ascend-amphitheater-nashville-tn-poster-shirt/) [6]",
